<title>FRANCE: Brokers put out buy advices on Havas.</title>
<headline>Brokers put out buy advices on Havas.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers Cheuvreux de Virieu, ABN Amro and EIFB have put out &quot;buy&quot; advices on Havas this morning ahead of a possible change in its share capital, fund managers said.</p>
<p>Cheuvreux went to buy (Note 2) from sell, EIFB to buy from underweight and ABN's Massonaud to &quot;+&quot; from &quot;-&quot;.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
